  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Frisian Egg: preparing for a liquid egg production facility in Karachi, Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Frisian Egg is a Dutch SME company specialised in egg processing. Together with its local joint venture partner Buksh Feeds it has invested in a liquid egg production facility in Karachi in Pakistan with the support of a DGGF loan.To prepare for and to minimise risks of the investments, Technical Assistance was provided through DGGF. This included on site monitoring of the construction of the plant and test runs to guarantee compliance with ISO and HACCPP requirements, training of staff on high quality production standards and training of local sourcing suppliers to upgrade and secure egg quality.The project was successful and sustainable knowledge transfer was provided by training 57 people, of which 27 employees on food and fire safety and 30 supplying egg farmers on sorting, cleaning and handling eggs in compliance with EU and Pakistan health and safety regulations.</narrative>
  </description>
